invariant: INV-16
file: ct.h
catches: softmul_test
reason: dropping the carry out of ct_widemul_opaque's cross sum makes its
  product wrong whenever that sum passes 2^32. Its one caller never gets
  there -- mlk_compress's operands keep the cross sum under 2^28 -- so
  the FIPS 203 answers over the decomposition pass; only the full-range
  edge grid and 200k random products in softmul_test reach it

--- old
    uint32_t mid_carry = (uint32_t)(mid < lh);
--- new
    uint32_t mid_carry = 0;
